id: rest
name: Rest
# "These Adventuring Maneuvers are possessed by all Characters."
universal: true
prerequisite: N/A
sessionLimit: 1
timeCost: 8 Hours
# "Regain Life and Ki Points equal to half of their respective maximums."
regainShare: 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A full night's rest, once an Adventuring Session: half your Life and Ki Points back.
text: >
  Rest: With a full night’s rest, you feel refreshed and ready to go.
  –Prerequisite: N/A
  –Session Limit: 1
  –Time Cost: 8 Hours
  –Effect: Regain Life and Ki Points equal to half of their respective maximums.

---

# Used from the Adventure tab, outside a Combat Encounter: the use counts at once (it was
# attempted), and the card's button gives the Life and Ki Points once the table says the full
# Time Cost was spent. Interrupted, the button is never pressed.
#
# Travel and Rest: used during a Medium or Long Travel under 2 days, the Travel costs no Ki
# Points - the Travel window's "Rested on the way".
